        "Title": "Third Time&apos;s the Charm",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHSEA",
        "PublicId": "121203578989",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository deb93f61-a6c2-4691-8524-1353510483c4).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47. Your targets are Jason Portman, Blake Nathaniel, and Axel Phenniger. Well, you know Portman. How he has survived our last two hits is an enigma. Please make sure he doesnt come back this time. A battle axe should kill him. Nathaniel stole the Cloud Serpent from under Sophia Washington (a providence operative)&apos;s nose. She requested that he dies to this fine relic. Phenniger, AKA Master of Ceremonies, is refusing to lead the Pheonix Ceremony. Take them out.\r-Arthur Edwards, The Constant",
